                                "sense_id": "f6b382a1-bfa1-3ea8-a192-ac4537bff531",
                                "text": "[...] and at a great foredeal already; [and as for] such foredeal that they despair not of the...a deal, but that through the help of God, [our Grace and] other good ministers, these personages which [shall be now] sent shall undoubtedly conclude [...]"
                            },
