                                "sense_id": "f6b382a1-bfa1-3ea8-a192-ac4537bff531",
                                "text": "And thus the battaile was great, and oftentimes that one partie was at a foredele and anon at an afterdele, which endured long."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "34f4608b-84b6-4a37-9044-29c46c2a9b51",
                                "sense_id": "f6b382a1-bfa1-3ea8-a192-ac4537bff531",
                                "text": "And though this be a great foredeal, and an excellent jewel, yet the great and unspeakable glory, that in time to come shall be declared in us, hath not yet appeared."
                            }
